    "notes": "The provided interface carries a data element the required one does not ask for, which is what a subset means and what the exporting tools this project imports from produce routinely. The `status` is `staged`: nothing here is a safety act, so the only thing between this delta and the disk is the host's own approval. The connector carries no `composition` key, so it is drawn in the root — the same shape `examples/create-interface-ports-and-connector.json` states for two ports naming ONE interface, which is the exchange this one is the widened twin of."
